        "Planning gate passes (complete_confounding only, balanced).",
        "Reassignment for chamber: r' = 2 x ceil(3/2) = 4 runs per recipe (1 extra), 2 per recipe x chamber cell, 8 runs; the revised declaration matches T2 with chamber as a block; the planned layout passes the exact estimability check.",
